            "type": "game",
            "name": "The Warriorlock",
            "steam_appid": 340500,
            "required_age": "18",
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340500/extras/a92b8572c8fe37bf9eba5a940832ffee.avif?t=1667522623\" width=616 height=108 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br><br>Entranced into a deep dreamscape by the hallucinogenic spores of a mind-devouring alien creature, a young explorer is unwittingly recast a challenger in a realm of unconscious fantasy, where empowered with super-human abilities of might and magic, he must crawl a punishing gauntlet of dark entities and monsters to defeat the labyrinth of his captor's mind game—proving himself a champion morsel worthy of digestion.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340500/extras/490d20e4f314818807217e5cda4c12ee.avif?t=1667522623\" width=616 height=198 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Comical story-driven RPG with punishing strategic turn-based combat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Animated custom battle system, with enemy bribe option, stat-driven turn order <br>and Action-Point charging gauges for unleashing special attacks and talents.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choice of party members to customize and balance your own 4-character battle crew.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomized loot &amp; spell drops—no two players will ever receive all the same items or skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rare enchanted items–rings, amulets and objects–that can be equipped <br>to any party member class to channel powerful entities in battle.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive and extensive soundtrack.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Created and developed by just a guy.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><br><br>The Warriorlock was created as a comically-inspired linear RPG, with a lighthearted picturebook-style presentation and original story. <br><br>I developed the game by heavily customizing a simple ruby script engine to create a one-of-a-kind homebrew grind crawler, with a 6-core character stat system akin to the original <i>Dungeons &amp; Dragons</i> standard, a hybridized action/turn-based battle system, pre-rendered game paths, randomized treasure drops for nearly all items and spells, and a hand-tailored menu inventory system with detailed descriptions and bonus stat points for steady character progression.",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340500/extras/a92b8572c8fe37bf9eba5a940832ffee.avif?t=1667522623\" width=616 height=108 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br><br>Entranced into a deep dreamscape by the hallucinogenic spores of a mind-devouring alien creature, a young explorer is unwittingly recast a challenger in a realm of unconscious fantasy, where empowered with super-human abilities of might and magic, he must crawl a punishing gauntlet of dark entities and monsters to defeat the labyrinth of his captor's mind game—proving himself a champion morsel worthy of digestion.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/340500/extras/490d20e4f314818807217e5cda4c12ee.avif?t=1667522623\" width=616 height=198 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Comical story-driven RPG with punishing strategic turn-based combat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Animated custom battle system, with enemy bribe option, stat-driven turn order <br>and Action-Point charging gauges for unleashing special attacks and talents.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choice of party members to customize and balance your own 4-character battle crew.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomized loot &amp; spell drops—no two players will ever receive all the same items or skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rare enchanted items–rings, amulets and objects–that can be equipped <br>to any party member class to channel powerful entities in battle.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive and extensive soundtrack.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Created and developed by just a guy.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><br><br>The Warriorlock was created as a comically-inspired linear RPG, with a lighthearted picturebook-style presentation and original story. <br><br>I developed the game by heavily customizing a simple ruby script engine to create a one-of-a-kind homebrew grind crawler, with a 6-core character stat system akin to the original <i>Dungeons &amp; Dragons</i> standard, a hybridized action/turn-based battle system, pre-rendered game paths, randomized treasure drops for nearly all items and spells, and a hand-tailored menu inventory system with detailed descriptions and bonus stat points for steady character progression.",
            "short_description": "The Warriorlock is a story-driven adventure RPG, with plenty of dialogue, humor and deadly miles of classic turn-based grinding. Are you hard enough?",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
